11	// This file covers the command-line contract of how `darksafe plan` receives
12	// the config file path: how the path argument is taken in, and what the user
13	// sees on the two output streams and the exit status when a config cannot be
14	// obtained. The filtering, fault-domain batching and business validation rules
15	// are covered elsewhere (plan_test.go, spreadby_cli_test.go,
16	// all_rejected_cli_test.go); here only the "obtain one config file" step is
